# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large/Archive directories
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anchored with a leading slash so they match ONLY these root directories.
# Unanchored, `models/` also matched worker/src/retina_worker/models/ and
# `shared/` matched the tracked schema source in shared/. Files already
# tracked stay tracked, so nothing broke loudly — but `git add <dir>` skips
# ignored paths silently, so staging by directory dropped source files
# without failing. `shared/` is removed outright rather than anchored:
# shared/schemas/*.json is the declared source of truth (CLAUDE.md 1.2) and
# lives at the root, so any form of the rule would ignore real source.
# (`data /`, with a stray space, matched nothing; root data/ is already
# covered under "Data & Logs" above.)
/v1/
/models/

# Custom Additions
MSVPD_Unified_Dataset/
decospan_small/
output/

# Decospan-derived AdaCLIP run output (private customer imagery).
# Untracked as of the F1 fix; the files remain on disk and in git history.
research/unsupervised/AdaCLIP/custom_adaclip/results/v21/